Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:49:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] mfreadwrite: Encode samples and implement
 IMFSinkWriter::Finalize().

Run written samples through the converter and encoder transforms instead of passing raw frames to the stream sink, set the encoder input type when a converter is inserted, and implement Finalize(): drain the transforms, wait for the sink to consume queued samples, finalize and shut down the media sink.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
